  <running_head>INVENIENDI VERUM. PARS I.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">ad me pertinente, deque multis aliis mihi</l>
    <l n="2">per illud præsentibus, quæ in corpus meum,</l>
    <l n="3">&amp; hoc in meam animam, immotæ</l>
    <l n="4">certitu- dinis vividitatem consciam imprimant &amp; ex-</l>
    <l n="5">citant. Nec minus indubia experior con-</l>
    <l n="6">scientia, me facultates desiderandi, atten-</l>
    <l n="7">dendi seu percipiendi, assentiendi, &amp; plu-</l>
    <l n="8">res alias, posse pro lubitu, modo ad hæc,</l>
    <l n="9">modo ad illa obiecta, idque plus minusve</l>
    <l n="10">applicare &amp; determinare. Ita ut quicquid</l>
    <l n="11">stridula futilitate auribus meis occinant Sce-</l>
    <l n="12">ptici nasutuli (quos infanos aliis hinc secu-</l>
    <l n="13">turis fundamentis &amp; ratiocinationibus, eo-</l>
    <l n="14">rum nænias evententibus, confutandos re-</l>
    <l n="15">linquo) nullatenus apud me serio dubitare</l>
    <l n="16">possim, me esse, conscium &amp; cogitantem</l>
    <l n="17">esse, optandi, intelligendi, acquiscendi,</l>
    <l n="18">amandi, lætandi actibus &amp; potentiis gaude-</l>
    <l n="19">re; &amp; corpore proprio multis aliis circum-</l>
    <l n="20">cinćto esse præditum; ac præterea pollere</l>
    <l n="21">libertate, sive potentia determinandi cogi-</l>
    <l n="22">tationes motionesque plurimas ex principio</l>
    <l n="23">mihi intimo, nec a me diverso, nec ab alio</l>
    <l n="24">quam a me determinato.</l>
    <l n="25" para="true">XIII. Insuper quamprimum per ætatem</l>
    <l n="26">licuit generalius cogitare de rerum causis,</l>
    <l n="27">deque objecto aliquo quod sit causa mei</l>
    <l n="28">&amp; rerum omnium potens, bona, vera, ju-</l>
    <l n="29">sta, immortalis, infinita, sapientissima,</l>
    <l n="30">liberrimaque, &amp; perfectissima, modus inti-</l>
    <l n="31">mus quo objectum illud cogitata mea tan-</l>
    <l n="32">gebat, desiderium inimitabiliter inefcabat,</l>
    <l n="33">intellectum veluti objectum illo dignum im-</l>
    <l n="34">plebat &amp; absorbebat, acquiescentiam seda-</l>
    <l n="35">bat,</l>
    <l n="36" type="foot" para="true">xiii. Deinde</l>
    <l n="37" type="foot">eundem ex</l>
    <l n="38" type="foot">sensu intimo</l>
    <l n="39" type="foot">ante omnem</l>
    <l n="40" type="foot">aliam demonstra-</l>
    <l n="41" type="foot">tionem,</l>
    <l n="42" type="foot">convinci de Dei existentia.</l>
  </main_text>
